      <description>
        <![CDATA[<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" class="gd_tbl_wrap"><tr><td style="background-color: #dddddd; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important" bgcolor="#dddddd"><table class="main-table" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="yahoo" style="width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td style="padding: 15px 0 20px;" class="mobile-padding">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color: #FFF; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td id="main-header" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Header" style="background-color: #000000; padding: 0px;" bgcolor="#000000">
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2017/11/1650665/govdelivery-development_original.png" style="width: 600px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Department of Development" width="600" height="225">
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td id="main-date" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Date" class="thin" style="background-color: #eeeeee; padding: 15px;" bgcolor="#eeeeee">
<h1 style="text-align: start; line-height: 110%; font-weight: normal; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; margin: 0;" align="start">Small Business Impact Survey</h1>
<div class="govd_hr"><div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr></div></div>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Good evening.  You are receiving this message because you recently received a grant through the Columbus-Franklin County COVID-19 Small Business Response and Recovery Fund, and we need information to inform how we continue to support small businesses that only you can help provide.</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">We are actively collecting feedback on how we performed during this engagement and are requesting that you complete a <strong>client satisfaction survey which you can access <a href="https://survey.alchemer.com/s3/6223187/Client-Satisfaction-Survey-Columbus-Franklin-County-COVID-19-Small-Business-Response-and-Recovery-Fund?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="Client Survey-Columbus-Franklin-County-COVID-19-Small-Business-Response-and-Recovery-Fund" rel="noopener" style="color: #00966a; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">here</a>. </strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">We anticipate that this survey will take fewer than 5 minutes of your time, and we ask that you complete it <strong>before 11:59pm ET on Friday March, 26.</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Your input is invaluable in shaping the future for small businesses in our community.  If you have any questions, please contact me at <a href="mailto:hagolatt@columbus.gov" style="color: #00966a; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">hagolatt@columbus.gov</a>.</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Thank you for your consideration, and we look forward to hearing from you.</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"><br>Sincerely,</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Henry A. Golatt, Program Development Coordinator</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"><a href="https://www.columbus.gov/development/economic-development/Small-Business/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #00966a; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Office of Small Business and Entrepreneur Development</a></p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"><em> </em></p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"><em>“Together, Let’s Make Positive Impacts”</em></p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">City of Columbus</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Department of Development</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Economic Development Division</p>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: start; line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;" align="start"> </p>
